  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td> </td> <td>List I (Species)</td> <td> </td> <td>List II (Electronic distribution)</td> </tr> <tr> <td>A.</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></td> <td>i.</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>8</mn></msup></math></td> </tr> <tr> <td>B.</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math></td> <td>ii.</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math></td> </tr> <tr> <td>C.</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ni</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></td> <td>iii.</td> <td>.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math></td> </tr> <tr> <td>D.</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math></td> <td>iv.</td> <td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></math></td> </tr> </tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
